      en: ["Founded on November 13, 1749, by Jesuit Sebastian de Yegros.", "The name honors Saint Stanislaus Kostka.", "Home to the Museum of History and Jesuit Art.", "Important junction between National Routes 3 and 10.", "The region produces cotton, tobacco, and yerba mate.", "Santaní is famous for its folk music and local poets."],
